   "source": [
    "Buttons:\n",
    "--> Bootstrap buttons are pre-designed button styles helps to create attractive and responsive buttons\n",
    "--> Bootstrap provides button classes,sizes,colors,states,groups and special button behaviors\n",
    "--> Button classes: .btn, .btn-primary, .btn-secondary, .btn-success, .btn-danger, .btn-warning, .btn-info, .btn-light, .btn-dark\n",
    "--> Button sizes: .btn-lg, .btn-sm, .btn-block\n",
    "--> Button colors: .btn-primary, .btn-secondary, .btn-success, .btn-danger, .btn-warning, .btn-info, .btn-light, .btn-dark\n",
    "--> Button states: .active, .disabled\n",
    "--> Button groups: .btn-group, .btn-toolbar\n",
    "--> Special button behaviors: .btn-toggle, .btn-toggle-2, .btn-toggle-3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "25287a15",
   "metadata": {
    "vscode": {
     "languageId": "raw"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "Basic button syntax:\n",
    "<button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Click Me</button>\n",
    "--> btn : base class for all buttons\n",
    "--> btn-primary : specific style for primary button\n",
    "--> Click Me : button text"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "4114a4d7",
   "metadata": {
    "vscode": {
     "languageId": "raw"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "Bootstrap button colors:\n",
    "--> Primary: .btn-primary (blue)\n",
    "--> Secondary: .btn-secondary (gray)\n",
    "--> Success: .btn-success (green)\n",
    "--> Danger: .btn-danger (red)\n",
    "--> Warning: .btn-warning (yellow)\n",
    "--> Info: .btn-info (cyan)\n",
    "--> Light: .btn-light (light gray)\n",
    "--> Dark: .btn-dark (dark gray)\n",
    "note : class=\"container mt-3\">  is also a Bootstrap utility combined with a layout class"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "6edbf631",
   "metadata": {
    "vscode": {
     "languageId": "raw"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "Bootstrap outline buttons:\n",
    "--> Instead of solid colors\n",
    "--> <button class=\"btn btn-outline-primary\">Primary</button>\n",
    "--> btn-outline-* : creates border-only buttons ( Border visible,background transparent)"
   ]
  },
